{arr: Soundscape: night sounds.}
{arr: A: voice + dvojnice (double flute) solo + drone (bordun) + percussion.}
{arr: A1 B1: tutti melody, singing + chords.}
{arr: A2 B2: the same + instruments play the melody.}
{arr: A3 B3: two-part singing (dvoglasje)!}
{arr: Ai Bi: instrumental! (Ai without percussion).}
{arr: Special instrumental + solos: | Dm | G | Dm | G | Dm | G | Bb | C |}
{arr: A4 B4: 'Dremle mi se mila majko' a cappella, dirty (prljavo).}
{arr: A5 B5: everyone, everything, really gritty (svi sve, al ono baš grr).}
{arr: Outro: loop 'i zagrljena i poljubljena', fade out -> intro: voice + dvojnice + night soundscape.}
{note: A = the first four lines of each stanza, B = the last four. Board writes C/Am: C on the word, Am right after (heard on the recording).}
{note: Board writes B for Bb in the special instrumental (Croatian).}
{evidence: Board photo '04 Dremle mi se flipcharts.jpeg': chords on stanza 1 (DM, G, F, C/AM), the special-instrumental row DM G DM G DM G B C.}
{evidence: Demucs other+bass chroma, 1.0 s windows, Viterbi over Dm,G,C,Am,F,Bb,A7: a steady Dm-G alternation through all sung parts; line ends C (1 window) then Am (2-6 windows) at 3:58, 4:18, 4:40, 8:14, 8:26, 8:39: C/Am = C then Am.}
{evidence: 5:19-5:42: | Dm G | Bb C | repeating, the special instrumental as written.}
{evidence: basic-pitch MIDI: D 1.00, A 0.46, C 0.31, B 0.31, F 0.27, E 0.21, G 0.16, Bb 0.02: D Dorian (B natural from the G chord); Bb only in the special instrumental.}
{evidence: DaVinci Resolve Voice Isolation render of the vocal (21.11.2026) used for vocal-activity windows.}
{uncertain: 'kano kraj mulca': mulac is not a common word; read as 'mule' (rhyme with vujca), marked (?) in the translation. Needs a speaker of the dialect.}
{uncertain: 'A šta ću ti ja?' is idiomatic: 'And what can I do about it?' / 'What good is that to me?'.}
{uncertain: The old PDF of 19.11.2026 had the words of a different song ('Dremle mi se, dremle, na krovu golobek'); replaced with Pjesme tekstovi.pdf.}
{uncertain: Meter not measured reliably; the beat tracker reports ~136 BPM.}

{section: 1}
[Dm]Dremle mi [G]se, mi[Dm]la maj[G]ko, || I'm so sleepy, dear mother,
[Dm]spavala bi [C]ja. [Am] || I would like to sleep.
[Dm]Legni, [G]kćeri, [Dm]pokraj [G]vujca. || Lie down, daughter, beside your uncle.
[Dm]A šta [F]ću ti [C]ja? [Am] || And what can I do?

[Dm]Legla kraj [G]vujca [Dm]kano [G]kraj mulca, || I lay beside my uncle as if beside a mule (?),
[Dm]zima je [C]meni. [Am] || I am cold.
[Dm]Nit [G]zagrljena, [Dm]nit polju[G]bljena, || Neither embraced nor kissed,
[Dm]zima [F]je [C]meni. [Am] || I am cold.

{section: 2}
[Dm]Dremle mi [G]se, mi[Dm]la maj[G]ko, || I'm so sleepy, dear mother,
[Dm]spavala bi [C]ja. [Am] || I would like to sleep.
[Dm]Legni, [G]kćeri, [Dm]pokraj [G]oca. || Lie down, daughter, beside your father.
[Dm]A šta [F]ću ti [C]ja? [Am] || And what can I do?

[Dm]Legla kraj [G]oca [Dm]kano [G]kraj koca, || I lay beside my father as if beside a rough blanket,
[Dm]zima je [C]meni. [Am] || I am cold.
[Dm]Nit [G]zagrljena, [Dm]nit polju[G]bljena, || Neither embraced nor kissed,
[Dm]zima [F]je [C]meni. [Am] || I am cold.

