{section: 5}
[Dm]Dremle mi [G]se, mi[Dm]la maj[G]ko, || I'm so sleepy, dear mother,
[Dm]spavala bi [C]ja. [Am] || I would like to sleep.
[Dm]Legni, [G]kćeri, [Dm]pokraj [G]draga. || Lie down, daughter, beside your sweetheart.
[Dm]A šta [F]ću ti [C]ja? [Am] || And what can I do?

[Dm]Legla kraj [G]draga [Dm]kano [G]kraj blaga, || I lay beside my sweetheart as if beside a treasure,
[Dm]vruće je [C]meni. [Am] || I am hot.
[Dm]I [G]zagrljena [Dm]i polju[G]bljena, || Both embraced and kissed,
[Dm]vruće [F]je [C]meni. [Am] || I am hot.
